# Game screenshots are Digital Extremes' content and may show account details.
# The images themselves stay local and are not in the repository; the tests that
# need them report "skipped" when they are missing.
*.png
*.jpg
*.webm
# A saved ScanResult carries both: the frames it cut tiles from and a crop of
# every tile, which is the same content under a different extension.
*.pickle
# Except the header strips of the reward overlay's check: 441 x 108 pixels
# of the yellow word "REWARDS" over a moving background, no names, no account.
!header/
!header/*.png
